      "refersTo": "offer",
      "description": "Offer HTML dengan nominal kuat dan garis emas tipis.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-offer\"><div class=\"ds-offer-top\"><h2>Voucher Sat-Set</h2><span>Kotagede Jewellery</span></div><div class=\"ds-offer-main\"><p>Potongan hingga</p><p class=\"ds-offer-amount\">Rp800.000</p></div><div class=\"ds-offer-bottom\"><div><p>Harga voucher</p><strong>Rp100.000</strong></div><div><p>Minimum transaksi</p><strong>Rp8.000.000</strong></div></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-offer{background:var(--color-primary,#174C40);color:var(--color-surface,#FFFFFF);border-radius:16px;padding:40px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui,'Segoe UI',sans-serif);}.ds-offer-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding-bottom:28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-gold,#D8B66B);}.ds-offer-top h2{font-size:26px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.18;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0;}.ds-offer-top span{color:var(--color-offer-muted,#E6EDE4);font-size:14px;}.ds-offer-main{padding-block:32px;}.ds-offer-main p{margin:0;color:var(--color-offer-muted,#E6EDE4);}.ds-offer-main .ds-offer-amount{font-size:clamp(44px,4.5vw,72px);font-weight:650;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--color-surface,#FFFFFF);margin:12px 0;}.ds-offer-bottom{border-top:1px dashed #7BA58F;padding-top:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;}.ds-offer-bottom p{font-size:13px;color:var(--color-offer-muted,#E6EDE4);margin:0 0 4px;}.ds-offer-bottom strong{font-size:22px;}@media(min-width:1600px){.ds-offer{padding:48px;}}@media(max-width:1199px){.ds-offer{padding:28px;}.ds-offer-bottom strong{font-size:20px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-offer-main .ds-offer-amount{font-size:48px;}.ds-offer-top h2{font-size:22px;}.ds-offer-bottom{gap:16px;}}@media(max-width:359px){.ds-offer{padding:22px;}.ds-offer-main .ds-offer-amount{font-size:42px;}.ds-offer-bottom strong{font-size:18px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Konfirmasi tindakan",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "confirmation",
      "description": "Ringkasan tindakan sensitif; aplikasi membuka dialog native dengan fokus awal Batal dan nilai input terbaru. Contoh statis terbuka.",
      "html": "<dialog class=\"ds-confirm\" open aria-labelledby=\"ds-confirm-title\" aria-describedby=\"ds-confirm-message\"><h2 id=\"ds-confirm-title\">Kunci potongan voucher?</h2><p id=\"ds-confirm-message\">Voucher akan menjadi terpakai. Masukkan potongan terkunci ke order yang sama; klaim tidak dapat dibatalkan otomatis.</p><dl class=\"ds-confirm-detail\"><dt>Cabang</dt><dd>Cabang pilihan</dd><dt>Nomor order</dt><dd>ORDER-CONTOH</dd></dl><div class=\"ds-confirm-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-confirm-cancel\">Batal</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-confirm-primary\">Kunci potongan dan klaim</button></div></dialog>",
      "css": ".ds-confirm{position:relative;margin:auto;width:min(560px,calc(100% - 32px));max-height:calc(100dvh - 32px);padding:32px;border:1px solid var(--color-rule,#DDE4DD);border-radius:16px;background:var(--color-surface,#FFFFFF);color:var(--color-ink,#19352C);overflow-y:auto;font:16px/1.55 var(--font-sans,system-ui,'Segoe UI',sans-serif);}.ds-confirm::backdrop{background:#142D26B8;}.ds-confirm h2{font-size:24px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.18;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 16px;}.ds-confirm p{margin:0 0 16px;max-width:72ch;}.ds-confirm-detail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(110px,1fr) minmax(0,2fr);gap:14px 20px;margin:24px 0;font-size:14px;}.ds-confirm-detail dt{color:var(--color-muted,#52675D);}.ds-confirm-detail dd{margin:0;font-weight:500;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-confirm-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;}.ds-confirm-actions button{max-width:100%;white-space:normal;}.ds-confirm-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;min-height:48px;padding:12px 20px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;background:var(--color-primary,#174C40);color:var(--color-surface,#FFFFFF);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.55;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms ease-out,border-color 180ms ease-out;font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui,'Segoe UI',sans-serif);}.ds-confirm-primary:hover{background:var(--color-primary-hover,#103A30);color:var(--color-surface,#FFFFFF);}.ds-confirm-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-focus,#1A65AD);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-confirm-primary:disabled{background:var(--color-rule,#DDE4DD);border-color:var(--color-rule,#DDE4DD);color:var(--color-muted,#52675D);cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-confirm-primary{transition:none;}}.ds-confirm-cancel{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:12px 20px;border:1px solid var(--color-control,#75877D);border-radius:8px;background:var(--color-surface,#FFFFFF);color:var(--color-primary,#174C40);font:600 14px/1.55 var(--font-sans,system-ui,'Segoe UI',sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms ease-out,border-color 180ms ease-out;}.ds-confirm-cancel:hover{background:var(--color-canvas,#F7F8F5);}.ds-confirm-cancel:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-focus,#1A65AD);outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-confirm-cancel{transition:none;}}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-confirm{padding:24px;border-radius:12px;}.ds-confirm-detail{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px;}.ds-confirm-detail dd{margin-bottom:12px;}.ds-confirm-actions{flex-direction:column;}.ds-confirm-actions button{width:100%;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Toast feedback",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "feedback-toast",
      "description": "Pesan rutin nonblocking dengan tutup berlabel; timeout runtime 6 detik mempertahankan pesan bila fokus masih di dalamnya. Contoh distage agar posisi fixed terikat pada preview.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-feedback-stage\"><div class=\"ds-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"><span>Link pesanan tersalin. Jaga link ini tetap pribadi.</span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Tutup pesan\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12 M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-feedback-stage{position:relative;transform:translate(0);min-height:160px;}.ds-feedback{position:fixed;bottom:24px;right:24px;z-index:60;width:min(440px,calc(100% - 32px));display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;margin:0;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #AFCAB9;border-radius:8px;background:#EDF5EF;color:var(--color-success,#226B45);font:14px/1.55 var(--font-sans,system-ui,'Segoe UI',sans-serif);overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-feedback span{flex:1;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-feedback button{flex-shrink:0;min-width:44px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--color-primary,#174C40);cursor:pointer;}.ds-feedback button:hover{color:var(--color-primary-hover,#103A30);}.ds-feedback button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-focus,#1A65AD);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-feedback svg{width:20px;height:20px;}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-feedback{bottom:16px;right:16px;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Kartu layanan butik",
    "overview": "Hijau dalam, putih hangat, detail emas kecil dan tipografi sistem membentuk layanan yang bersih, profesional dan sederhana. Angka rupiah kuat serta status yang jelas membantu pelanggan memahami voucher dan operator menyelesaikan tugas. Identitas yang dipin pengguna dipertahankan; komposisi baru memberi ruang layar yang lebih berguna.\n\nPermukaan datar, garis halus dan sudut lembut menjaga hierarki. Satu tindakan utama memimpin setiap tahap; detail sekunder dapat dibuka sesuai kebutuhan. HTML membentuk kartu promosi, SVG native membentuk ikon garis, dan QR voucher dihasilkan saat runtime. QRIS merchant menggunakan gambar asli; logo, foto dan informasi cabang resmi menunggu aset KGJ.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Putih hangat dengan tindakan hijau dalam dan emas yang hemat.",
      "Angka rupiah tegas; status selalu memiliki teks.",
      "Layout desktop fluid, kolom mobile ringkas dan permukaan datar.",
      "Navigasi operator tetap di desktop dan drawer native di mobile.",
      "QRIS pembayaran utuh dan QR voucher memiliki fungsi berbeda."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Status Text Rule",
        "body": "Setiap status memiliki teks yang dapat dibaca tanpa membedakan warna.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Money Rule",
        "body": "Rupiah memakai pemisah ribuan titik; waktu transaksi dan deadline diberi label WIB.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Pemisahan informasi memakai nada permukaan, garis dan jarak sebelum menambah efek kedalaman.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Correctable Error Rule",
        "body": "Error yang perlu diperbaiki tetap dekat data dan membuka jalur fokus; toast hanya melengkapi feedback tindakan.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do gunakan putih hangat, hijau dalam, font sistem dan aksen emas kecil yang disetujui.",
      "Do pakai ruang desktop fluid dan susun keputusan mobile dalam satu kolom yang jelas.",
      "Do tampilkan nominal, status teks, label, fokus visible dan alternatif input manual dekat tindakan.",
      "Do pertahankan QRIS merchant utuh dan bedakan QR voucher dari QRIS pembayaran.",
      "Do gunakan pagination server, disclosure dan lazy scanner sesuai kebutuhan nyata."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't menambahkan identitas/foto/QRIS rekaan atau mengubah payload gambar merchant.",
      "Don't menyampaikan status dengan warna saja atau menghilangkan fokus keyboard.",
      "Don't menyamakan klik pelanggan dengan pembayaran verified atau scan dengan klaim.",
      "Don't memasukkan aturan bisnis baru atau detail credential/tracking ke alur pelanggan.",
      "Don't mengklaim fixture, screenshot atau output detector parsial sebagai sertifikasi aksesibilitas atau transaksi live."
    ]
  }
}
